# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization.
# The working copy is LF too, whatever core.autocrlf says on the PC: Git for
# Windows sets it to true system-wide, which wants CRLF on disk and warned
# ("LF will be replaced by CRLF") on every LF file. The solution file stays
# CRLF, the way Visual Studio writes it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sln text eol=crlf
